step Shadowshard Fragments
  zone map 1445
  tip Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments from Maraudon and return them to Archmage Tervosh in Theramore on the coast of Dustwallow Marsh. · Hold it for Maraudon (the Maraudon + Alcaz trip around 53). · The fragments drop inside Maraudon. ~3,450 XP.
  complete 7070 "Shadowshard Fragments" map 1443 @28.9,58.3
  note Keep it: you hand this in later on the route.

