step Tiara of the Deep
  zone map 1445
  tip Hydromancer Velratha walks around the pool in the far west part of Zul'Farrak (the same pool where the Mallet summons Gahz'rilla). · Kill her for the Tiara of the Deep and bring it to Tabetha in Dustwallow. · ~6,050 XP.
  complete 2846 "Tiara of the Deep"
  turnin 2846 "Tiara of the Deep" @46.1,57.1

step Mage's Wand
  zone map 1445
  tip Mage hands in Rituals of Power + Items of Power, then Mage's Wand: Tabetha does a ritual and the mage picks a wand. · Right next to where you grab Tiara of the Deep.
  turnin 1952 "Mage's Wand" @46.1,57.1

